      "id": "claim_f92b0af6838a4a649b05ba416171a372",
      "statement": "The web package’s automated verification is centered on Vitest and a build-plus-TypeScript pass: `test` runs `vitest run`, while `check-types` runs `vite build && tsc --noEmit`.",
