      "id": "claim_7b135676c6dc497c8569a0e288d76b65",
      "statement": "The main backend package exposes several verification layers through package scripts: `test` and `test:unit` run `go test ./...`, `test:integration` runs tagged integration suites, `test:race` runs `go test -race ./...`, and `check-types` runs `go vet ./...`.",
      "evidence": [
