      "statement": "Backend decision-memory handler tests define the session-to-AI-runtime boundary by proving that chat forwarding includes prior session history plus the new user message, forwards previously recommended product IDs as `allowed_comparison_ids`, persists the assistant reply, and blocks anonymous users from reading or chatting against another anonymous user’s session before any AI-runtime call is made.",
